AB  - Chinese White Dolphins (CWD) is listed as the national crucial first-class protected wild animal of China, about 80 % of CWD in China lives in the Pear River Estuary. The Hongkong -Zhuhai -Macao Bridge island and tunnel project (HZMBIT) is located in the core and buffer zones of CWD National Nature Reserve, it is very difficult to protect CWD. We analyzed the impacts of HZMBIT project construction on CWD to reduce the interference of CWD by strengthen management, design scheme optimization, and construction scheme optimization, in order to ensure the normal life and reproduction of CWD in the reserve area.
